The annual picnic of the Cincinnati Linux Users Group will
be on Saturday, June 7 at the Gilton Estate.  For details,
go to:

http://www.cglug.org/announce/2003picnic.html

This is a members only event.  If you are not a member, you
can join at the picnic.  Dues will be prorated for new
members.  If you were a member last year, you are expected
to pay the full year's dues.

Meat will be provided by John Morrell & Co. and we thank
them for their support.  Drinks will be provided by CLUG.
Everyone is asked to bring something to share.

We will have a board meeting at 3.  Board meetings are open
to members.  We encourage them to attend.

RSVPs are requested by Wednesday, June 4th.  We don't
require people to send RSVPs but it helps us get a count.

